      "contributing": {"text": "# Contributing\n\nSee README for what this repository is and how to set up a development environment.\n\n## Issues\n\nJudging question: does it help?\n\nAccepted:\n- yes\n\nRejected:\n- no\n\n## Pull requests\n\nStandard flow.\n"},
